+Sol verification of the limiter dense-path diagnosis, round 2 (VERIFY-LIMITER-2.md). Evidence only.
+
+Every scripted path assumes the scratch directory D named at the top of each script, holding:
+  wt-base/      a worktree of the verified tip (220c5db5) with limiter-diag-2-harness/ copied in
+                from limiter-diagnosis-2-prototypes.patch (only the harness, not its lib.rs edits);
+  lib.rs.orig   the pristine crates/true-peak-limiter/src/lib.rs of that tree.
+
+Clean single-change builds (the point of this verification): clean.sh writes lib.rs from
+lib.rs.orig through variants.py then variants2.py, builds, and restores the pristine file.
+  ./clean.sh native NAME SPEC   -> bin/NAME, the round-2 kernel rig (limiter-diag-2-harness)
+  ./clean.sh web NAME SPEC      -> web/NAME.wasm, host_web built with the delivery cargo line
+SPEC parts ("+"-joined): seed (limiter-2-1), skewr, skew, pair, splat (class A detector shapes),
+tree, tree2 (class B), vh (limiter-2-2), bcf (limiter-2-3 no-copy), statonly (stationary dispatch
+only), p2s (pass-2 delay streams), unchk (unchecked rings, diagnostic), nogain, nodet
+(truncations), none.
+
+Identity: ./diff.sh W START COUNT BLOCKS bin... (the #990 differential's combined digest);
+node web.mjs digest web/*.wasm (BLOCKS=300).
+Timing (under the lock): abba.sh kbench ROUNDS BLOCKS PASSES bin... ; webtime.sh PROCS arm... ;
+detrep.sh N ROUNDS (the isolated detector benchmark, detbench/). quiet.sh gates a run on load.
+Summaries: python3 summ.py RAW BASE (the diagnosis's summ.py); python3 websumm.py RAW BASE web|wmin.
